00012:       "conclusion": "The exact catalogue row says first clear temporary record, give skip prompt, return victory. Actual debug-skip branch gives three messages before clearing. Main WP58 correctly states prompts come first in its outcome table and otherwise only clear-before-return. This is a narrow intra-document wording/order question, not failure of normal recording or request to change source behavior. Root must decide whether optional clarification or no-required scope disposition is appropriate.",
