00017:       "formal": "F07 whole RC section156–190 supplied. W04 line165 says 先清空临时记录、给跳过提示、返回胜利. F05 whole §2 supplied: line21 clear-before-return, line33 explicitly先给跳过提示, §7line168 clear-before-victory. No source fact is replaced with an ideal order.",
00018:       "necessary_actual_read": "Own full initial R10/F05/F07 and fresh actual full relevant portions30cdd9/c7d5da/f2bc1f; no old reading inherited. Source identity and literal unit hashes supplied.",
