00025:       "minimal_order_contrast": "Immediately upon first message call actual temporary field still retains the prior value; a literal strict clear-then-message reading of W04 expects nil already. This observation is static control-flow, no custom callback/plugin runtime executed.",
00026:       "failure_prefix": "If one of the message calls fails before line46, this branch has not yet cleared the field. No assertion that such failure is normally reachable or that a new transactional API is required.",
00027:       "cancel": "No separate cancel choice on this debug-skip branch. Modifier condition false takes ordinary wrapper path; in-battle pbDebugRun is a separate method, not this case."
